<title>USA: PG&amp;E finalizes holding company formation.</title>
<headline>PG&amp;E finalizes holding company formation.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Gas and Electric Co said on Wednesday its board gave final approval to the formation of a new holding company, effective January 1.</p>
<p>&quot;The holding company structure will improve our ability to respond to new business opportunities and changes in the industry,&quot; said Stanley Skinner, PG&amp;E's chairman. &quot;It will enhance the financial separation of our businesses and provide more financing flexibility.&quot;</p>
</text>
